    <pageContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a58b29f0-29c6-47b8-b8ce-329b38fbed3c",
      "key": "3b6a0ee0-14c7-46e2-a020-4d8e66ec0d01",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "Layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch2\u003EOur commitment to sustainability\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMany of our clients share the same concerns and are similarly committed to actions which help to limit the damage to our environment.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETechnology, workplaces and work-related travel all negatively impact the environment. In our everyday working practices, our own technology infrastructure and our client work, we are committed to approaches which limit our carbon footprint and support our collective future.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHowever, we also acknowledge that we are not perfect and are always actively looking to improve our practices.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EOur sustainability policies\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E1. Greener hosting:\u003C/strong\u003E We only work with website hosts that are committed to greener data centres. Both Microsoft and AWS are committed to ensuring that their data centres are powered by renewables.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E2. Optimised environment:\u003C/strong\u003E Where possible we set up and optimise environments to reduce their data emissions. We use methods such as rightsizing through automation and caching using CDNs.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E3. Optimised website and content:\u003C/strong\u003E Where possible we consider the environment in website and content design, for example reducing the number of pages and assets.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E4. Reporting and transparency:\u003C/strong\u003E We keep an eye on the carbon footprint of our website using the Website Carbon calculator and verification from the Green Web Foundation.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E5. Reducing work travel:\u003C/strong\u003E We are committed to keeping work-related travel to a minimum. Meetings are predominantly carried out online.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E6. Sustainable office space:\u003C/strong\u003E Our choice of office space was influenced by sustainable credentials. The Blade in Reading is one of the most eco-friendly buildings in the area.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E7. Partners and clients:\u003C/strong\u003E We strive to work with technology providers, partners and clients who share a commitment to sustainability.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003E8. Anti-greenwashing:\u003C/strong\u003E We\u0027re committed to giving an accurate and honest description of our record on sustainability.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
